  m_Name: Lore6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_06
  title: The End Is Near
  fullText: 'Im here again.

    Or perhaps I never left.


    I remember the moon.

    The
    mountain and the clouds.


    Something feels different.

    Something is changing.

    Something
    is coming closer.


    Closer...


    Like something beneath the water has
    begun to stir.

    I cannot explain it.

    Only this feeling...


    Do not
    look back...

    Try to Remember.'
